      "id": "openai-1788280134349-0",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "Announced the deprecation of whisper-1, gpt-4o-transcribe, gpt-4o-mini-transcribe, and gpt-4o-transcribe-diarize. These models will shut down on February 26, 2027. Migrate to gpt-live-transcribe or gpt-transcribe. See the transcription guide and deprecations page.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1788280134349-1",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "The Assistants API shut down on August 26, 2026. Migrate to the Responses API and Conversations API using the migration guide.",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1788280134349-2",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "API customers can now select regional processing for an individual request by using a prefixed domain with an API key from a project having Global geography. Existing eligibility, data retention control, endpoint, and model support requirements continue to apply. Learn more in the data controls guid",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1788280134349-3",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "GPT-5.6 Sol now costs $4 per million input tokens and $20 per million output tokens, representing 20% lower input pricing and 33% lower output pricing. GPT-5.6 Sol’s promotional pricing is available at least through November 21, 2026. See pricing details.",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1788280134349-4",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "Released the Prompt Caching dashboard on the OpenAI API platform. Track your cache hit rate over time, cache reads per write, and the breakdown of cache-read, cache-write, and uncached tokens to understand your caching efficiency and identify opportunities to improve. Filter metrics by model and ser",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1788280134349-5",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "Transparent backgrounds are now available in preview for gpt-image-2 and gpt-image-2-2026-04-21 in the Images API and the Responses API image generation tool. Set background to transparent and use png or webp output; jpeg does not support transparent backgrounds. Learn more in the image generation g",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1788280134349-6",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "Announced Ultrafast mode, a new API service tier for GPT-5.6 Sol that runs up to 14x faster than Standard processing. Available in limited preview to select customers. Sign up to receive updates on Ultrafast mode here.",
      "severity": "low",
      "severityLabel": "Miglioramento",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1788280134350-7",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "Start with Daybreak Blue for most defensive security work. It provides access to general-purpose models such as GPT-5.6 Sol for vulnerability discovery, secure code review, detection engineering, incident response, malware analysis, and patch validation. Read more here.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1788280134350-8",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "Daybreak Red provides separately approved access to purpose-trained models such as GPT-5.6 Cyber for authorized vulnerability reproduction, exploit validation, penetration testing, red teaming, and complex system analysis.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-1788280134350-9",
      "provider": "openai",
      "providerName": "OpenAI (GPT)",
      "providerColor": "#059669",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "These models require separate approval and provisioning. You can apply to join the Daybreak program here. More details on pricing here.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://platform.openai.com/docs/changelog"
    },
