      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "This page lists the latest features and improvements for Microsoft 365 Copilot. It includes changes that are generally available (Current Channel for Microsoft 365 apps) and specific to each platform.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1788280135637-1",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "Copilot features are introduced using a safe deployment model, gradually rolling out to a subset of users within a tenant before expanding across the organization.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1788280135637-2",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "Use Python when Editing with Copilot in Excel [Windows, Mac, Web]",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1788280135637-3",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "Edit with Copilot helps you work with Python in Excel by executing Python code for advanced analysis, automation, and data transformation with results outputted directly in your workbook.",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1788280135637-4",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "What changed: You can now use Edit with Copilot to perform advanced data analysis (statistics, simulations, advanced visualizations etc.) with your workbook data. Existing security and execution controls continue to help manage how code runs.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1788280135637-5",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-01",
      "text": "Why: Python is widely used for data analysis, visualization, and automation. Bringing Copilot-assisted Python editing into Excel helps users move from intent to working analysis faster without switching tools.",
      "severity": "low",
      "severityLabel": "Miglioramento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
